{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"ac68b9dc-9847-4e6f-8ec2-6b4367414408","agentId":"a08591c75ba641e6e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"调研 AlphaEvolve / FunSearch / OpenEvolve / ShinkaEvolve 在\"演化优化算法启发式\"的具体 cookbook。\n\n**背景：** Round 1/2 提过 AlphaEvolve PoC，但没具体到\"怎么 prompt LLM 演化 cut / heuristic\"。\n\n**调研重点（≤800 字）：**\n1. FunSearch bin packing 的 prompt + evaluator 范式\n2. AlphaEvolve 的 SEARCH/REPLACE 具体使用\n3. OpenEvolve 配置 LLM + evaluator 的具体步骤\n4. 怎么演化 cut 形式（不只是 ranking 函数）\n5. 评估器要返回哪些 metric\n6. 失败模式（无意义代码 / 作弊 / 数值不稳）的预防\n\n输出末尾：\"给我们项目的 1 周 PoC 完整 evaluator + prompt 框架\""},"uuid":"8dbee990-2379-492d-854d-7f392a3d32d4","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:10:31.329Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
